 Aljada business park</li><li>15 minutes’ walk from University City</li></ul><p>Aljada - the hub of new Sharjah, is a landmark development that will redefine Sharjah living. It is a destination where everything is at your fingertips, where living, working, entertainment, recreation, shopping and culture all come together in a vibrant and unique urban environment.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/533/images/2023/11/05/JMDohEmDiCto9xx01SBfVFNPQ0zuLnQkLvwsvagZ.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/11/05/JMDohEmDiCto9xx01SBfVFNPQ0zuLnQkLvwsvagZ.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/533/images/2023/11/05/9dj5rCC3bUOX3Siu63U9giXKhoYEmeut1YBcNBzJ.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/11/05/9dj5rCC3bUOX3Siu63U9giXKhoYEmeut1YBcNBzJ.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/533/images/2023/11/05/cQcndDmiOu29P0F36Fvel1H2EZIVMkNDVw2huRuc.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/11/05/cQcndDmiOu29P0F36Fvel1H2EZIVMkNDVw2huRuc.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/533/images/2023/11/05/ZMKxZvwGr232h7BB5qJGJqXcbrM79ldCeuhJAkP0.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/11/05/ZMKxZvwGr232h7BB5qJGJqXcbrM79ldCeuhJAkP0.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":3063,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2023/10/31/nZuYpgAlkQaHvHfgV5okd5uUAxGiIm9UCJFSfkZG.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1507,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1368,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"767 ft²","media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Aljada_Rove_cd266e369a.jpg","hash":"Aljada_Rove_cd266e369a","name":"Aljada Rove"},"title":"1 Bedroom","kitchen":null,"park